      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Base rate / reference class: no complete prior-year agency 097 final obligations series was available in the draft evidence, so the admissible base rate is the six inspected public USAspending-derived running snapshots, ranging from 129.7 to 246.7 billion dollars, with latest inspected current persistence at 246.7. This is a weak full-year prior because the target resolves after fiscal-year close, so I use current-snapshot persistence plus budget scaling rather than treating 246.7 as the final forecast."
